def matches(line, pattern, flags):
    if "-x" in flags:
        line = line.strip("\n")
    if "-i" in flags:
        line = line.lower()
        pattern = pattern.lower()
    return pattern in line
```

And invert with -v.

Also, for `-l` with `-v`… not tested with a combination of -l and -v. No problem.

